data: {"id": "d639f68b5daa4608-thinking-parallel_evidence-1626", "run_id": "d639f68b5daa4608", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 生命周期与状态（来自 describe + yaml）\n- **Pod UID**: `da351bf0-c4ab-47a0-b24d-7c7a75950753`，节点 `node2`，Pod IP `172.16.104.34`\n- **当前状态**: `Running`，但容器 `app` 状态为 `Waiting`，Reason = `CrashLoopBackOff`，`Ready=False`\n- **Last State**: `Terminated`，Reason = **`OOMKilled`**，Exit Code = **`137`**\n- **重启次数**: **4次**（PromQL 显示 `restarts_total=3`，describe 显示 `Restart Count: 4`）\n- **资源限制**: **memory limit = 64Mi**，cpu limit = 100m\n- **命令**: `python3 -u -c \"import time; print('startup all", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789378174452, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "d639f68b5daa4608-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "d639f68b5daa4608", "seq": 1627, "ts_ms": 1789378182936, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 47.457, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v15", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/d639f68b5daa4608-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "dce10d8d23b60bdd1582108e35bc7901a41b6a5a1305cd26331a0dd7f12a80f9", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "9d310ebd5a2b0602e3c47ae79afecbca1746cc5ccb87d1a3fe229bfce72e4a48"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "d639f68b5daa4608-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "d639f68b5daa4608", "seq": 1628, "ts_ms": 1789378182937, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "d639f68b5daa4608-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "d639f68b5daa4608", "seq": 1629, "ts_ms": 1789378193988, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 11.052, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1761, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v15/workload 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，容器反复重启 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v15` (fact-099c291361f8) | 确认容器因失败而反复重启，直接呈现 CrashLoopBackOff 现象 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` terminated with reason: `OOMKilled` (fact-017c8579083b) | 确认容器终止的直接机制是 OOM 杀手介入 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` exit_code: `137` (fact-6fe0c0060673) | Exit Code 137 进一步印证进程是被信号 9 (SIGKILL) 强制终止的 OOM |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` = 1 for `OOMKilled` (fact-32165e523e1e) | 独立监控指标确认容器最近一次终止原因为 OOMKilled |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `startup allocation 256Mi` (fact-43abbd48fc32) | 揭示应用启动阶段申请了大量内存，是触发 OOM 的具体操作行为 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container `app` resource_limit.memory = `64Mi` (fact-1360d2914ecc) | 提供资源硬性限制事实，与日志中的 256Mi 申请值形成矛盾 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 的 OOMKilled 终止状态与 Metrics 的 OOMKilled 指标互相印证了容器死亡的直接原因。日志显示应用启动时分配 256Mi 内存，而 K8s 配置的硬性限制仅为 64Mi，这构成了因果链的核心证据，解释了为何 OOM 会发生。Exit Code 137 则是这一过程在系统层面的标准退出码。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n资源配置不当(memory limit=64Mi) → 启动申请超限(256Mi) → 触发内核OOM Killer → Exit Code 137 & OOMKilled → 容器重启失败形成 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 资源配置与应用启动需求严重不匹配。\n1. 容器被配置了极低的内存硬限制 `64Mi` (fact-1360d2914ecc)。\n2. 应用启动时尝试分配 `256Mi` 内存 (fact-43abbd48fc32)。\n3. 这一操作超出了内核允许的限制，直接导致 OOM Killer 杀死进程 (fact-017c8579083b, fact-32165e523e1e, fact-43abbd48fc32)。\n4. 进程的反复终止和 Kubelet 的重试策略导致 Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 (fact-04ca9ffd52c7, fact-099c291361f8)。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v15/workload 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，容器反复重启 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v15` (fact-099c291361f8) | 确认容器因失败而反复重启，直接呈现 CrashLoopBackOff 现象 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` terminated with reason: `OOMKilled` (fact-017c8579083b) | 确认容器终止的直接机制是 OOM 杀手介入 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` exit_code: `137` (fact-6fe0c0060673) | Exit Code 137 进一步印证进程是被信号 9 (SIGKILL) 强制终止的 OOM |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` = 1 for `OOMKilled` (fact-32165e523e1e) | 独立监控指标确认容器最近一次终止原因为 OOMKilled |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `startup allocation 256Mi` (fact-43abbd48fc32) | 揭示应用启动阶段申请了大量内存，是触发 OOM 的具体操作行为 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container `app` resource_limit.memory = `64Mi` (fact-1360d2914ecc) | 提供资源硬性限制事实，与日志中的 256Mi 申请值形成矛盾 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 的 OOMKilled 终止状态与 Metrics 的 OOMKilled 指标互相印证了容器死亡的直接原因。日志显示应用启动时分配 256Mi 内存，而 K8s 配置的硬性限制仅为 64Mi，这构成了因果链的核心证据，解释了为何 OOM 会发生。Exit Code 137 则是这一过程在系统层面的标准退出码。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n资源配置不当(memory limit=64Mi) → 启动申请超限(256Mi) → 触发内核OOM Killer → Exit Code 137 & OOMKilled → 容器重启失败形成 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 资源配置与应用启动需求严重不匹配。\n1. 容器被配置了极低的内存硬限制 `64Mi` (fact-1360d2914ecc)。\n2. 应用启动时尝试分配 `256Mi` 内存 (fact-43abbd48fc32)。\n3. 这一操作超出了内核允许的限制，直接导致 OOM Killer 杀死进程 (fact-017c8579083b, fact-32165e523e1e, fact-43abbd48fc32)。\n4. 进程的反复终止和 Kubelet 的重试策略导致 Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 (fact-04ca9ffd52c7, fact-099c291361f8)。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

