data: {"id": "d639f68b5daa4608-final", "run_id": "d639f68b5daa4608", "seq": 1631, "ts_ms": 1789378194004, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v15/workload 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，容器反复重启 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v15` (fact-099c291361f8) | 确认容器因失败而反复重启，直接呈现 CrashLoopBackOff 现象 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` terminated with reason: `OOMKilled` (fact-017c8579083b) | 确认容器终止的直接机制是 OOM 杀手介入 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` exit_code: `137` (fact-6fe0c0060673) | Exit Code 137 进一步印证进程是被信号 9 (SIGKILL) 强制终止的 OOM |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` = 1 for `OOMKilled` (fact-32165e523e1e) | 独立监控指标确认容器最近一次终止原因为 OOMKilled |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `startup allocation 256Mi` (fact-43abbd48fc32) | 揭示应用启动阶段申请了大量内存，是触发 OOM 的具体操作行为 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container `app` resource_limit.memory = `64Mi` (fact-1360d2914ecc) | 提供资源硬性限制事实，与日志中的 256Mi 申请值形成矛盾 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 的 OOMKilled 终止状态与 Metrics 的 OOMKilled 指标互相印证了容器死亡的直接原因。日志显示应用启动时分配 256Mi 内存，而 K8s 配置的硬性限制仅为 64Mi，这构成了因果链的核心证据，解释了为何 OOM 会发生。Exit Code 137 则是这一过程在系统层面的标准退出码。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n资源配置不当(memory limit=64Mi) → 启动申请超限(256Mi) → 触发内核OOM Killer → Exit Code 137 & OOMKilled → 容器重启失败形成 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 资源配置与应用启动需求严重不匹配。\n1. 容器被配置了极低的内存硬限制 `64Mi` (fact-1360d2914ecc)。\n2. 应用启动时尝试分配 `256Mi` 内存 (fact-43abbd48fc32)。\n3. 这一操作超出了内核允许的限制，直接导致 OOM Killer 杀死进程 (fact-017c8579083b, fact-32165e523e1e, fact-43abbd48fc32)。\n4. 进程的反复终止和 Kubelet 的重试策略导致 Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 (fact-04ca9ffd52c7, fact-099c291361f8)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 47.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v15/workload: 47.5s (Evidence 39.0s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v15/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 74.292, "metrics": {"run_id": "d639f68b5daa4608", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 74.29733872413635, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 74297.33872413635, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 69660.38942337036, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 11513.098955154419, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4058.9733123779297}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15761.363983154297, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 47456.88033103943, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11051.777601242065, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

